1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You...

2
00:00:02,627 --> 00:00:03,816
Are you sure you are okay?

3
00:00:05,422 --> 00:00:06,881
It's nothing
don't overthink it.

4
00:00:08,967 --> 00:00:10,447
I will be okay
after taking some rest.

5
00:00:10,635 --> 00:00:11,678
It doesn't make any sense.

6
00:00:12,053 --> 00:00:14,166
Why did you push yourself
when you were hurt?

7
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:17,058
This happened before.

8
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:19,101
What?

9
00:00:19,185 --> 00:00:21,416
When I was in middle school
my club was getting closed.

10
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:24,388
We didn't have good results
and few members, that's why.

11
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:27,694
But I just wanted to
play baseball with friends...

12
00:00:28,361 --> 00:00:29,612
My friends and I thought

13
00:00:30,905 --> 00:00:33,283
we could keep playing baseball
if we get the results.

14
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:34,701
So we threw balls like crazy.

15
00:00:35,201 --> 00:00:36,201
But...

16
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:38,104
At the final moment
of the tournament...

17
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:40,623
My team lost because
of my mistake.

18
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:42,709
My club got closed

19
00:00:43,668 --> 00:00:45,045
and everyone got separated.

20
00:00:46,087 --> 00:00:47,422
Then later I realized that

21
00:00:48,339 --> 00:00:50,592
my shoulder got messed
up from pitching too much.

22
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:53,436
I don't want to make
the same mistakes twice.

23
00:00:55,263 --> 00:00:56,890
I will protect
the team myself.

24
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:00,852
Enough with the talking.

25
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:01,686
Back to training.

26
00:01:01,686 --> 00:01:02,686
Take your clothes off.

27
00:01:04,313 --> 00:01:04,647
What?

28
00:01:05,022 --> 00:01:06,022
Take your clothes off

29
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:08,150
and lie down.
